Input: n Learning tasks, warm-up iterations $n_{warm}$ , task iterations $n_{evo}$ , evolution generations G
/* Warm-up stage */
1 Initialize population $P = \emptyset$ and external Pareto archive $EP = \emptyset$ ;
2 Generate n evenly distributed weight vectors $W = \{\omega_1, \ldots, \omega_n\}$ ;
3 Initialize n policy networks $\{\pi_{\theta_1}, \ldots, \pi_{\theta_n}\}$ with LSTM architecture;
4 Initialize n value networks $\{V_{\pi_{\theta_1}}, \ldots, V_{\pi_{\theta_n}}\}$ with LSTM architecture;
5 Generate task set $T_{task} = \{\Gamma_1, \ldots, \Gamma_n\}$ , where $\Gamma_i = \langle \omega_i, \pi_{\theta_i}, V_{\pi_{\theta_i}} \rangle$ ;
6 $P' \leftarrow \text{MMPPO}(T_{task}, n_{warm})$ ; // Obtaining the initial population
7 Update EP by using Pareto dominance;
/* Evolutionary stage */
8 for generation = 1 to G do
9 $P \leftarrow \text{TPU}(P, P')$ ; // Updating the task population utilizing Algorithm 3
10 $T_{task} \leftarrow \text{TaskSelection}(W, P)$ ; // Selecting the learning tasks utilizing Algorithm 4
11 $P' \leftarrow \text{MMPPO}(T_{task}, n_{evo})$ ; // Obtaining the offspring population utilizing Algorithm 2
12 Update EP by using Pareto dominance;
Output: Pareto archive EP

